{"about_the_game":"<i><strong>&quot;What was erased is not always forgotten.&quot;</strong></i><br><br>You are a \u201cmemory repairman\u201d, brought in to digitally cleanse a corrupted fragment of a mind. But something has gone wrong. The simulation has spiraled out of control. An AI named SIGMA is searching for its identity, and every action you take could change it \u2014 or make it even more dangerous.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choices have consequences: not everything you \u201crestore\u201d was meant to see the light<br></li><li>Immersive atmosphere: scenes filled with anxiety, nostalgia, and paranoia<br></li><li>Multiple endings: shaped by your interaction with SIGMA</li></ul><br>Memory can't simply be restored. It must be relived \u2014 or lost forever.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877350?t=1768485079","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877350?t=1768485079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877350/c719d8b361b292e6cecca94bb8f8e5c1fae1b9b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768485079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877350/c719d8b361b292e6cecca94bb8f8e5c1fae1b9b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768485079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<i><strong>&quot;What was erased is not always forgotten.&quot;</strong></i><br><br>You are a \u201cmemory repairman\u201d, brought in to digitally cleanse a corrupted fragment of a mind. But something has gone wrong. The simulation has spiraled out of co